      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Recommended Resolutions",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The `ImageScaleToTotalPixels` node automatically rescales Reference Image #1 so its dimensions feed the latent at a reasonable size (megapixels can be edited on that node). The `EmptyHiDreamO1LatentImage` size is then snapped to a multiple of 32 by the two math nodes.\n\nThe HiDream O1 model is trained at these resolutions; outputs that land close to one of them tend to be highest quality:\n\n| Width | Height | Category   |\n|-------|--------|------------|\n| 2048  | 2048   | Square     |\n| 2304  | 1728   | Landscape  |\n| 2304  | 1792   | Landscape  |\n| 2496  | 1664   | Landscape  |\n| 2560  | 1440   | Landscape  |\n| 3104  | 1312   | Landscape  |\n| 1728  | 2304   | Portrait   |\n| 1792  | 2304   | Portrait   |\n| 1664  | 2496   | Portrait   |\n| 1440  | 2560   | Portrait   |\n| 1312  | 3104   | Portrait   |\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
