      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The HiDream O1 model accepts up to **10 reference images**. Below, the first slot is **enabled** (mode 0) and slots 2-10 are **bypassed** (mode 4) so the wires stay visible. To use an additional reference, click a bypassed LoadImage node and press **Ctrl+B** to enable it, then choose an image. Only Reference Image #1 drives the output dimensions."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
